{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-11","kind":"proposition","title":"比例相等的传递性","englishTitle":"Ratios which are the same with the same ratio are also the same with one another.","book":5,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","contentId":"euclid-5-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"885d603842459cacc13d69017bf0d0a5a812af16c74f58c1d4cf91a0142c200f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-11.statement","euclid-5-11.proof.1","euclid-5-11.proof.2","euclid-5-11.proof.3","euclid-5-11.proof.4","euclid-5-11.proof.5","euclid-5-11.proof.6","euclid-5-11.conclusion","euclid-5-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b21191b9496227d3ad40ea0ee94b9c9776079012bcee0ced6b300f6480303014","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Ratios which are the same with the same ratio are also the same with one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"比相同,比相同,彼此也相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df80fc65a77848ef805635a4db96dd57fd8d4c119849b6ed88f08e8f498d977b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, as A is to B, so let C be to D, and, as C is to D, so let E be to F; I say that, as A is to B, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A比B,所以C比D,C比D,E比F;我说,A比B等于E比F；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d20c6b956cc8f09212a4cfb34d496e266ed8eabe9589cb90e73a8dffd7383e83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For of A, C, E let equimultiples G, H, K be taken, and of B, D, F other, chance, equimultiples L, M, N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A中,C、E被劫持,同倍数被劫持,G被劫持,H被劫持,K被劫持,B被劫持,D被劫持,F被劫持,机会为同倍数,L、M和N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f02802b898c32e57db82b707d0517eee63a052e00839ea95d187fe855859f34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and of A, C equimultiples G, H have been taken, and of B, D other, chance, equimultiples L, M, therefore, if G is in excess of L, H is also in excess of M, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A-B的比等于C-D的比,A、C、同倍数、G、H的比,B、D其他机会,同倍数、L、M的比,因此,如果G超过L、H的比是相等的,那么,如果等于、等于、少于,则也超过M；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47862b9eda76966c9afa96b9e32a1b920f13ee825246b2bfb7c4f41cc5b1e835","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as C is to D, so is E to F, and of C, E equimultiples H, K have been taken, and of D, F other, chance, equimultiples M, N, therefore, if H is in excess of M, K is also in excess of N, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,C-D的比等于E-F的比,C、E、同倍数、H、K的比,D、F其他机会,同倍数、M、N的比,因此,如果H超过M、K的比是相等的,那么,如果等于、等于、少于,则也超过N；C 与 D 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"930f81331ac871a9c154ab5d1ec1e5e5d9e894858bea38967689abd0afa9e0ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But we saw that, if H was in excess of M, G was also in excess of L; if equal, equal; and if less, less; so that, in addition, if G is in excess of L, K is also in excess of N, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是我们看到,如果H多出M,G多出L;如果平等,那么平等;如果更少,那么更少;因此,如果G多出L,那么K多出N,如果平等,那么平等,那么,更少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e37b6a38d87b2b2156955a6e7a57c937cb65e54c720fe35a0c9dd7a78608767","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And G, K are equimultiples of A, E, while L, N are other, chance, equimultiples of B, F; therefore, as A is to B, so is E to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,K是A,E的同倍数,而L,N是另一个机会,B,F的同倍数;因此,A对B的比等于E对F的比；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-11.source","contentId":"euclid-5-11","revisionId":"euclid-5-11@raw-885d603842459cac","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e57371975d216bd43dab945af4f4ffcb8bffad075cc1d9d25e1b1063d2ebd2f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-16:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-16.proof.3","euclid-5-16.proof.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-18:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-18.proof.6"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5